{"shortname": "libreoffice", "name": "LibreOffice", "_id": "62687c041010bb5064e53e9a", "url": "https://sourceforge.net/p/libreoffice/", "private": false, "short_description": "LibreOffice is a free and powerful office suite, and a successor to OpenOffice. Its clean interface and feature-rich tools help you unleash your creativity and enhance your productivity.\r\n\r\nLibreOffice is Free and Open Source Software (FOSS) \u2013 development is open to new talent and new ideas, and our software is tested and used daily by a large and devoted user community. Your documents will look professional and clean, regardless of their purpose: a letter, a master thesis, a brochure, financial reports, marketing presentations, technical drawings and diagrams. LibreOffice makes your work look great while you focus on the content, thanks to its powerful styles system and structuring tools.\r\n\r\nLibreOffice is compatible with a wide range of document formats such as Microsoft\u00ae Word (.doc, .docx), Excel (.xls, .xlsx), PowerPoint (.ppt, .pptx) and Publisher. But LibreOffice goes much further with its native support for a modern and open standard (OpenDocument Format).", "creation_date": "2022-04-26", "summary": "A free and powerful office suite", "external_homepage": "https://www.libreoffice.org/", "video_url": "www.youtube.com/embed/3KC0ZdcA6s8?rel=0", "socialnetworks": [{"accounturl": "@libreoffice", "socialnetwork": "Twitter"}, {"accounturl": "https://www.facebook.com/libreoffice.org/", "socialnetwork": "Facebook"}], "status": "active", "moved_to_url": "", "preferred_support_tool": "_url", "preferred_support_url": "https://www.libreoffice.org/get-help/feedback/", "developers": [{"username": "cloph", "name": "Christian Lohmaier", "url": "https://sourceforge.net/u/cloph/"}, {"username": "floeff", "name": "Florian Effenberger", "url": "https://sourceforge.net/u/floeff/"}, {"username": "libreoffice", "name": "The Document Foundation", "url": "https://sourceforge.net/u/libreoffice/"